250 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/P 130 0 R
/T (Applications & Future Steps)
/E (Applications & Future Steps)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
251 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (Biomarker Validation - the collected EEG data can be compared with blink rate and heart rate to strengthen the validity of the Engagement Index as a biomarker of cognitive fatigue. By analyzing patterns across multiple participants, this project can contribute to a broader understanding of how cognitive overload develops over time.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
252 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (Real Time Feedbacks - In the future, with hardware capable of live EEG streaming, this framework could evolve into a true real-time closed-loop system. Such a system could instantly detect declining engagement or rising cognitive load and trigger timely interventions, making focus management more precise and personalized.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
253 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 130 0 R
/T (Applications)
/E (Applications)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
254 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 130 0 R
/T (Future Steps)
/E (Future Steps)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (Educational - Currently, this system does not operate in real time; instead, the data is analyzed retrospectively after the session ends. Nevertheless, this still provides valuable insights about individual cognitive fatigue patterns and optimal break timing. Students can use these results to better understand their focus patterns and adjust study strategies, such as modifying break timing or task duration.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (Beyond Education - there are potential medical applications. Similar EEG-based monitoring systems could support stroke rehabilitation by reinforcing beneficial neural activity patterns through neuroplasticity. They may also assist in monitoring attention disorders, tracking cognitive fatigue in concussion recovery, or supporting patients undergoing cognitive therapy. In the future, with hardware capable of live EEG streaming, this framework could evolve into a real-time closed-loop system that provides immediate feedback or therapeutic interventions in both academic and clinical settings.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
